OL,3,GNEWSABeing Wales' opposition party is a
OL,4,Awork in progress, says Reform's Tice
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,7,Fhas described the party's transition
OL,8,Finto the role of official opposition in
OL,9,Fthe Senedd as a "work in progress".
OL,11,FTaking questions ahead of the party's
OL,12,Fautumn conference, Tice said Reform was
OL,13,F"making a real difference" and
OL,14,F"challenging the status quo".
OL,16,FReform is by far the largest opposition
OL,17,Fparty in the new expanded Senedd
OL,18,Fchamber, winning 34 out of 96 seats in
OL,19,FMay's election.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
