OL,3,GNEWSABeing Wales' opposition party is a
OL,4,Awork in progress, says Reform's Tice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked for his assessment of the party's
OL,7,Fperformance in Wales over the past few
OL,8,Fmonths, Tice said a "proper debate" was
OL,9,Fnow being held in the country.
